      "content": "wait i thought vitamin c was a good thing for the kidneys? you just said it might reduce the risk but then said it could cause stones too... thats kinda confusing. if it helps with uric acid isnt that better for someone with oxalate stones? i really want to just start the 2500mg a day thing now so i dont have to deal with another stone soon. is there any reason i shouldn't just go for it?",
